# AMD graphics, for machines that have none. Neither product has an AMD GPU --
# el2 is an Adreno in an X1E80100, handheld an Adreno in a CQ8725S -- and neither
# is expected to drive an external one.
#
# amdgpu is one of the largest modules in the tree, so this is mostly a build
# time and image size win rather than a runtime one. The display-core and
# per-generation sub-options (DRM_AMD_DC, DC_FP, RADEON_USERPTR, HSA_AMD) depend
# on these and fall out on their own.
# CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU is not set
# CONFIG_DRM_RADEON is not set

# The rest of AMD's platform support, which is x86-laptop or AMD-server silicon:
# ACP is the audio coprocessor on AMD APUs, XGBE the 10G MAC on AMD Seattle.
# CONFIG_SND_SOC_AMD_ACP is not set
# CONFIG_AMD_XGBE is not set
